+ * -> GetVer(00) -> BID -> full 284-frame replay (ack_ms 0) -> 0x19. The
+ * replay's own 0x19 is the only accept evidence: the reset's wake, the
+ * pre-reset verdict and the identity read are anchors, not proof.
